<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1099_3501.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unsern</unclear> willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freuendtlich</unclear> dienst, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sunder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hohem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fleiß</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trewen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bereit</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vestrengen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frommen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear>, ersamen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weyßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besonder</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guote</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuendt</unclear>. Warumben der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erbar</unclear> unser burger <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stefan</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fher</unclear>, umb unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Interceßion</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuerderungschrifften</unclear> an Ewer
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ert</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angesuocht</unclear> und gebetten, das vernemen dieselben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inligendts</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eigendtlichs</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Freuendtlichs</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vleiß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pittendt</unclear>, Ewer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ert</unclear>. woellen mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verstorbnen</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Hansen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bindemmans</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weyb</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jetzo</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Thoman</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Siglienschen</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">husfrawen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dise</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ernstliche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verschaffung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear> laßen, damit dem suppli-
<lb n="5"/>canten, oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seinet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beuelch</unclear> haben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wirt</unclear>, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußstendige</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schulde</unclear> 411 kronen, 12 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kr</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">one</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fernern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffzug</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergnuegt</unclear> und be-
<lb n="6"/>zahlt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdtent</unclear>. Daran verfuegen Ewer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ert</unclear>. die billiche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hülpe</unclear> wir sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solhs</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jnn</unclear> dergleichen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear> andern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fällen</unclear>, umb die-
<lb n="7"/>selben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeuerdienen</unclear> willig. Datum <origDate when="1578-02-27" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mitwuchs</unclear> denn 27. Februarij, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ao</unclear> 1578</origDate>.
<lb n="8"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rathe</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Newenburg</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1099_3502.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="10"/>Denen gestrengen, frommen, fuersichtigen, ersamen
<lb n="11"/>und weisen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> und Rathe der Stat Santt
<lb n="12"/>Gallen</orgName>, unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bsndern</unclear> lieben und guten freunden.
</p>
